{"seq":3,"slug":"buffers-textures","title":"缓冲与纹理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/webgl/buffers-textures","wordCount":1416,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓冲与纹理\">缓冲与纹理</h1><p>着色器写好了，但它处理的数据从哪来？顶点着色器里那个 <code>attribute vec2 a_position</code> 不会凭空有值——你必须把顶点数据打包成 GPU 能读的<strong>缓冲</strong>，告诉 GPU 怎么解读它，再触发绘制。片元着色器里的图像采样也一样，图像要先上传成<strong>纹理</strong>才能被 <code>texture2D</code> 读到。缓冲与纹理是连接「CPU 侧的数据」和「GPU 侧的着色器」的两座桥。这篇文档讲清 VBO、EBO、VAO 如何组织顶点，以及纹理的上传、采样与 mipmap。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-数据进-gpu-的两条通道\">核心概念：数据进 GPU 的两条通道</h2><p>CPU 侧的数据要进 GPU，走两条通道：几何数据（顶点）走<strong>缓冲对象</strong>，图像数据走<strong>纹理对象</strong>。两者都要先在 GPU 里分配显存、上传数据，再在绘制时绑定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[JS TypedArray&lt;br/&gt;Float32Array 顶点] --&gt; B[VBO 顶点缓冲&lt;br/&gt;gl.ARRAY_BUFFER]&#10;  A2[Uint16Array 索引] --&gt; C[EBO 索引缓冲&lt;br/&gt;ELEMENT_ARRAY_BUFFER]&#10;  B --&gt; D[vertexAttribPointer&lt;br/&gt;告诉GPU如何切分]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[VAO 顶点数组对象&lt;br/&gt;记住绑定与布局]&#10;  F[图像 img/canvas/数据] --&gt; G[纹理对象&lt;br/&gt;texImage2D 上传]&#10;  G --&gt; H[采样器 uniform sampler2D]&#10;  E --&gt; I[drawElements/drawArrays]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[JS TypedArray&lt;br/&gt;Float32Array 顶点] --&gt; B[VBO 顶点缓冲&lt;br/&gt;gl.ARRAY_BUFFER]\n  A2[Uint16Array 索引] --&gt; C[EBO 索引缓冲&lt;br/&gt;ELEMENT_ARRAY_BUFFER]\n  B --&gt; D[vertexAttribPointer&lt;br/&gt;告诉GPU如何切分]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[VAO 顶点数组对象&lt;br/&gt;记住绑定与布局]\n  F[图像 img/canvas/数据] --&gt; G[纹理对象&lt;br/&gt;texImage2D 上传]\n  G --&gt; H[采样器 uniform sampler2D]\n  E --&gt; I[drawElements/drawArrays]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>关键在于 GPU 显存和 JS 内存是分离的两块，数据必须显式「上传」过去，而且要用<strong>类型化数组</strong>（<code>Float32Array</code>、<code>Uint16Array</code>）——普通 JS 数组不行，因为 GPU 需要紧凑、定类型的内存布局。上传是有成本的操作，所以静态几何应该只上传一次、反复绘制，这也是本篇和性能优化的连接点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"顶点缓冲-vbo-与属性指针\">顶点缓冲 VBO 与属性指针</h2><p>VBO（Vertex Buffer Object）把顶点数据存进 GPU 显存。但光有数据不够——一个 <code>Float32Array</code> 在 GPU 眼里只是一串浮点数，它不知道「每几个数是一个顶点」「哪几个是位置、哪几个是颜色」。<code>vertexAttribPointer</code> 就是那份「解读说明书」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const data = new Float32Array([&#10;  //  x,    y,     r,   g,   b     ← 每个顶点 5 个浮点：2 位置 + 3 颜色&#10;  0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.5, -0.5, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.5, -0.5, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0,&#10;]);&#10;const vbo = gl.createBuffer();&#10;gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, vbo);&#10;gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, data, gl.STATIC_DRAW); // 上传, STATIC=很少改&#10;&#10;const STRIDE = 5 * 4; // 每个顶点 5 个 float × 4 字节 = 20 字节&#10;gl.vertexAttribPointer(posLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, STRIDE, 0); // 位置: 偏移0&#10;gl.vertexAttribPointer(colorLoc, 3, gl.FLOAT, false, STRIDE, 2 * 4); // 颜色: 偏移8字节&#10;gl.enableVertexAttribArray(posLoc);&#10;gl.enableVertexAttribArray(colorLoc);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  //  x,    y,     r,   g,   b     ← 每个顶点 5 个浮点：2 位置 + 3 颜色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> vbo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bindBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ARRAY_BUFFER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vbo);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bufferData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ARRAY_BUFFER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">STATIC_DRAW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 上传, STATIC=很少改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> STRIDE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每个顶点 5 个 float × 4 字节 = 20 字节</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vertexAttribPointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(posLoc, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FLOAT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">STRIDE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 位置: 偏移0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vertexAttribPointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(colorLoc, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FLOAT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">STRIDE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 颜色: 偏移8字节</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enableVertexAttribArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(posLoc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enableVertexAttribArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(colorLoc);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里位置和颜色<strong>交错</strong>存在同一个缓冲里（interleaved），<code>stride</code>（跨距）告诉 GPU 相邻顶点间隔多少字节，<code>offset</code> 告诉它某个属性从哪开始。交错布局对 GPU 缓存友好，是主流做法。<code>bufferData</code> 的第三个参数 <code>STATIC_DRAW</code>/<code>DYNAMIC_DRAW</code>/<code>STREAM_DRAW</code> 是给驱动的提示——数据多久变一次，影响它放在哪种显存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"索引缓冲-ebo-别重复顶点\">索引缓冲 EBO：别重复顶点</h2><p>画一个矩形要两个三角形、六个顶点，但矩形只有四个角——用 VBO 直接画会重复存两个顶点。EBO（Element Buffer Object，索引缓冲）解决这个浪费：顶点只存一份，用索引数组指明「按什么顺序、连哪几个顶点成三角形」。</p>\n<p>顶点复用带来的节省对复杂模型很可观。设一个网格有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 个唯一顶点、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 个三角形，不用索引要存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 个顶点，用索引存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 个顶点加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 个索引。当每个顶点被多个三角形共享时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>≪</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V \\ll 3T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，而索引（<code>Uint16</code>，2 字节）比顶点（可能几十字节）小得多，节省的显存和带宽是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>节省</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>vertex</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{节省} \\approx (3T - V)\\cdot s_{\\text{vertex}} - 3T\\cdot s_{\\text{index}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节省</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vertex</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>vertex</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{vertex}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vertex</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{index}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，所以只要顶点被复用就划算。用 <code>gl.drawElements(gl.TRIANGLES, count, gl.UNSIGNED_SHORT, 0)</code> 代替 <code>drawArrays</code> 即可按索引绘制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>绑定目标</th>\n<th>存什么</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VBO</td>\n<td>Vertex Buffer Object</td>\n<td><code>ARRAY_BUFFER</code></td>\n<td>顶点属性</td>\n<td>几何数据进 GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EBO</td>\n<td>Element Buffer Object</td>\n<td><code>ELEMENT_ARRAY_BUFFER</code></td>\n<td>顶点索引</td>\n<td>顶点复用、省显存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VAO</td>\n<td>Vertex Array Object</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>缓冲绑定 + 属性布局</td>\n<td>免去每帧重设指针</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"vao-把绑定状态打包\">VAO：把绑定状态打包</h2><p>上面那一堆 <code>bindBuffer</code> + <code>vertexAttribPointer</code> + <code>enableVertexAttribArray</code>，如果每帧、每个物体都重来一遍，既啰嗦又是纯粹的状态切换开销（回顾 <a href=\"rendering-pipeline\">渲染管线</a> 里 WebGL 状态机的开销）。VAO（Vertex Array Object）把这一整套「缓冲绑定 + 属性布局」的配置<strong>打包成一个对象</strong>，配置一次，之后每帧只需 <code>bindVertexArray(vao)</code> 一行就恢复全部状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const vao = gl.createVertexArray();&#10;gl.bindVertexArray(vao);&#10;// —— 一次性配置 VBO / EBO / attribPointer ——&#10;gl.bindVertexArray(null);&#10;// 每帧渲染时：&#10;gl.bindVertexArray(vao);&#10;gl.drawElements(gl.TRIANGLES, count, gl.UNSIGNED_SHORT, 0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> vao</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createVertexArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bindVertexArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vao);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// —— 一次性配置 VBO / EBO / attribPointer ——</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bindVertexArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每帧渲染时：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bindVertexArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vao);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawElements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TRIANGLES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, count, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UNSIGNED_SHORT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>VAO 在 WebGL2 是核心特性（WebGL1 需 <code>OES_vertex_array_object</code> 扩展，但现在几乎全支持）。它是减少 draw call 前置开销的基础设施，直接服务于实践章 <a href=\"../practice/batching-performance\">批处理与性能</a> 里的状态排序优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"纹理-图像进-gpu-与采样\">纹理：图像进 GPU 与采样</h2><p>纹理是把图像喂给片元着色器的通道。上传用 <code>texImage2D</code>，图像源可以是 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code>、<code>ImageBitmap</code> 或原始 <code>TypedArray</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const tex = gl.createTexture();&#10;gl.bindTexture(gl.TEXTURE_2D, tex);&#10;gl.texImage2D(gl.TEXTURE_2D, 0, gl.RGBA, gl.RGBA, gl.UNSIGNED_BYTE, image);&#10;gl.texParameteri(gl.TEXTURE_2D, gl.TEXTURE_WRAP_S, gl.CLAMP_TO_EDGE); // 环绕方式&#10;gl.texParameteri(gl.TEXTURE_2D, gl.TEXTURE_MIN_FILTER, gl.LINEAR); // 缩小过滤&#10;gl.generateMipmap(gl.TEXTURE_2D); // 生成 mipmap 金字塔\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bindTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXTURE_2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tex);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">texImage2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXTURE_2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RGBA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RGBA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UNSIGNED_BYTE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, image);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">texParameteri</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXTURE_2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXTURE_WRAP_S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CLAMP_TO_EDGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 环绕方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">texParameteri</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXTURE_2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXTURE_MIN_FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">LINEAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 缩小过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">generateMipmap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXTURE_2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生成 mipmap 金字塔</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两组参数最关键。<strong>过滤方式</strong>（<code>TEXTURE_MIN_FILTER</code>/<code>MAG_FILTER</code>）决定纹理被缩放时如何取色：<code>NEAREST</code>（最近邻，像素风）或 <code>LINEAR</code>（双线性插值，平滑）。<strong>环绕方式</strong>（<code>WRAP_S</code>/<code>WRAP_T</code>）决定 UV 超出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 时的行为：<code>REPEAT</code>（平铺）、<code>CLAMP_TO_EDGE</code>（拉边）、<code>MIRRORED_REPEAT</code>（镜像）。</p>\n<p><strong>mipmap</strong> 是纹理缩小时防闪烁的关键：<code>generateMipmap</code> 预生成一串逐级减半的缩小版（原图、1/2、1/4……），GPU 采样时根据物体在屏幕上的大小自动挑最合适的一级，避免远处物体上高频纹理的摩尔纹与闪烁。代价是多约 1/3 的显存。注意 WebGL1 里非 2 的幂次尺寸纹理不能用 mipmap 和 REPEAT，WebGL2 放宽了这个限制。纹理坐标（UV）和采样的更多细节，见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals/buffers-and-textures\">Web 3D 可视化 · 缓冲与纹理</a>。上传大图前先解码成 <code>ImageBitmap</code> 能避免主线程卡顿，见 <a href=\"../canvas2d/images-pixels\">位图与像素操作</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GPU 显存与 JS 内存分离，几何数据经 VBO、图像数据经纹理显式上传，且必须用类型化数组；上传有成本，静态数据只传一次反复用。</li>\n<li>VBO 存顶点属性，<code>vertexAttribPointer</code> 用 stride/offset 说明如何切分（交错布局对缓存友好）；EBO 用索引复用顶点，顶点被多三角形共享时显著省显存与带宽。</li>\n<li>VAO 把「缓冲绑定 + 属性布局」打包成一个对象，每帧一行 <code>bindVertexArray</code> 恢复全部状态，是减少 draw call 前置开销的基础设施。</li>\n<li>纹理经 <code>texImage2D</code> 上传，过滤方式（NEAREST/LINEAR）、环绕方式（REPEAT/CLAMP）、mipmap（缩小防闪烁、代价约 1/3 显存）是三组关键参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"shaders-glsl\">着色器与 GLSL</a> 讲这些数据在着色器里如何被读取；VAO 与状态排序如何减少 draw call 见 <a href=\"../practice/batching-performance\">批处理与性能</a>；纹理上传前的解码见 <a href=\"../canvas2d/images-pixels\">位图与像素操作</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：UV 与纹理采样的更多细节见 <a href=\"../../web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals/buffers-and-textures\">Web 3D 可视化 · 缓冲与纹理</a>；下一代资源绑定模型见 <a href=\"../../webgpu-graphics/rendering/buffers-bindings\">WebGPU 图形 · 缓冲与绑定</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓冲与纹理","id":"缓冲与纹理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：数据进 GPU 的两条通道","id":"核心概念-数据进-gpu-的两条通道"},{"level":2,"text":"顶点缓冲 VBO 与属性指针","id":"顶点缓冲-vbo-与属性指针"},{"level":2,"text":"索引缓冲 EBO：别重复顶点","id":"索引缓冲-ebo-别重复顶点"},{"level":2,"text":"VAO：把绑定状态打包","id":"vao-把绑定状态打包"},{"level":2,"text":"纹理：图像进 GPU 与采样","id":"纹理-图像进-gpu-与采样"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"着色器与 GLSL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/webgl/shaders-glsl"},"next":{"title":"批处理与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/practice/batching-performance"}}